{"title": "Help! Trying to figure out how to help my aging parents with their finances 😥", "body": "Hey everyone, I'm a 19-year-old college student and I'm feeling a bit overwhelmed trying to figure out how to best help my parents with their finances. They're getting older, and I want to make sure they're taken care of, but I feel like I don't know where to even start. 

